/P 137 0 R
/E (They are navigating climate anxiety, identity questions, uncertainty, and a digital culture that constantly invites comparison, performance, and self-definition. Some educators have labelled these newer generations as challenging. This manual is for those who choose to see the traits of these new generations as invitations to rethink, update, and strengthen their practice. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
