/E (Alpha \(2010-2025*\) is more than managing "kids with screens" or compensating for short attention spans. It is about meeting generations who are digitally fluent, emotionally articulate, collaborative, and often deeply concerned about the world they are growing up in. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
