<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (Gen Z wants meaning, flexibility, and authenticity in the workplace. In work places where a healthy relationship between work-life balance is promoted, where hybrid employment arrangements are available, and where psychological well-being is encouraged, Gen Z are frequently observed as being significantly more satisfied. These kinds of conditions also ensure their retention in that place of work. They want open leadership, an inclusive organisational culture, and socially responsible employers. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
