/P 141 0 R
/E (Gen Z combines self-determination with strong interest in community service, activism and social justice. Digital platforms are channels for awareness-building, mobilisation, and disaster preparedness. This means that civic participation is evolving into hybrid digital-physical forms of engagement. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
