299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (Although many navigate the internet easily, research suggests that critically evaluating digital content can still be challenging. Studies on deepfakes and AI-generated media indicate that awareness of manipulation risks is often limited. Short-form video platforms, algorithmic feeds, and influencer culture can shape perceptions, interests, and purchasing behaviour, while social dynamics such as "fear of missing out" \(FOMO\) may affect well-being and decision-making. These findings highlight the importance of strengthening digital literacy, especially around critical thinking, media authenticity, and responsible technology use. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
