/E (In the majority of home situations, there are no rules governing a child's use of devices. There are a few preschools that have organised parenting education programmes that discuss the digital native generation and work with the parents to establish rules such as frequency, duration and content. It is hugely important that young people develop character qualities and competencies, including curiosity, adaptability, leadership, cognitive flexibility, dynamism and critical thinking. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
