<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (Some view points are that Alpha are more comfortable at home on their devices than they are being outside and experiencing open play. This view is not universal, it has also been noted that they are more aware of their mental and emotional health and take time away from their devices to play with their peers. Some studies show that up to 75% disconnect regularly for their health. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
