/E (Gen Z and Gen Alpha are adapting to the world that they have been handed. Their heightened awareness, digital fluency, humour, and social imagination are resources, not limitations. This chapter shares guidelines and methods that were proposed by youth workers, trainers and educators like you at the Inception Lab, that took place in Portugal 2025 as part of this Erasmus+ Youth project. These guidelines and methods can help you tap into those resources in a way that is grounded, doable, and aligned with your own practice. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
