/E (Staying in tune with new generations is an ongoing practice, not a checklist you can finish. It can be useful to think of yourself as a youth worker/trainer/educator ninja in the symbolic sense: quietly attentive, deeply aware of your environment, and ready to adapt your movements rather than forcing the space to fit you. You can begin today by slowing down to really observe, asking one genuine question, reflecting with a colleague, and adjusting one small habit in how you learn about these young people's worlds. Ganbatte!1)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
