954 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (Our invitation to you is to stay curious and look for the potential each generation brings. Beneath the new behaviours and the moments that stretch your expectations \(and sometimes your patience\), there are emerging skills, literacies, and forms of resilience being built in real time. By getting familiar with these skills - even when they seem strange, trivial, or "not how we used to do it" - you can learn from them rather than fight against them. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
